          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay держал Mac бодрым %@, пока вас не было."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你不在时，Belay 让 Mac 保持唤醒了 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay let your Mac sleep": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay hat deinen Mac schlafen lassen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay let your Mac sleep"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay dejó dormir el Mac"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay a laissé votre Mac s'endormir"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha lasciato dormire il Mac"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay отпустил Mac спать"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 已让 Mac 进入睡眠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay needs Accessibility access to press the button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay braucht Zugriff auf die Bedienungshilfen, um die Taste zu drücken."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay needs Accessibility access to press the button."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay necesita acceso a Accesibilidad para pulsar el botón."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay a besoin de l'accès Accessibilité pour appuyer sur le bouton."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha bisogno dell'accesso ad Accessibilità per premere il pulsante."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay нужен универсальный доступ, чтобы нажимать кнопку."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 需要辅助功能权限才能点按该按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay needs to read ~/.claude to tell when an agent is working. Nothing else is read, and nothing leaves this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um zu erkennen, wann ein Agent arbeitet, liest Belay ~/.claude. Mehr wird nicht gelesen, und nichts verlässt diesen Mac."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay needs to read ~/.claude to tell when an agent is working. Nothing else is read, and nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para saber cuándo trabaja un agente, Belay lee ~/.claude. No lee nada más y nada sale de este Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour savoir quand un agent travaille, Belay lit ~/.claude. Rien d'autre n'est lu, et rien ne quitte ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per sapere quando un agente lavora, Belay legge ~/.claude. Non legge altro e nulla lascia questo Mac."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Чтобы понимать, когда агент работает, Belay читает ~/.claude. Больше он ничего не читает, и ничего не покидает этот Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 需要读取 ~/.claude，才能判断智能体何时在工作。不会读取其他内容，也不会有任何内容离开这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay needs your permission to read %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay braucht die Erlaubnis, %@ zu lesen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay needs permission to read %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay necesita permiso para leer %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Belay a besoin de votre autorisation pour lire %@."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha bisogno del permesso per leggere %@."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay нужно разрешение на чтение %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 需要读取 %@ 的权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay opens the session that waits, answers, and brings back the one you had open. It waits for a pause while you are typing or clicking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay öffnet die wartende Sitzung, antwortet und holt die zurück, die du geöffnet hattest. Solange du tippst oder klickst, wartet es auf eine Pause."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay opens the session that waits, answers, and brings back the one you had open. It waits for a pause while you are typing or clicking."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay abre la sesión que espera, responde y vuelve a la que tenías abierta. Mientras escribes o haces clic, espera a una pausa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ouvre la session en attente, répond, puis revient à celle que vous aviez ouverte. Tant que vous tapez ou cliquez, il attend une pause."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay apre la sessione in attesa, risponde e riporta quella che avevi aperta. Mentre scrivi o fai clic, aspetta una pausa."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay открывает сессию, которая ждёт, отвечает и возвращает ту, что была открыта у вас. Пока вы печатаете или кликаете, он ждёт паузы."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 会打开正在等待的会话，作出回应，然后切回你原先打开的会话。你正在打字或点按时，它会等你停下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay reached its maximum awake time and stopped keeping your Mac awake.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay hat die maximale Wachzeit erreicht und lässt deinen Mac wieder schlafen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay reached the maximum awake time and let your Mac sleep."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay alcanzó el tiempo máximo despierto y dejó dormir el Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay a atteint la durée d'éveil maximale et a laissé votre Mac se mettre en veille."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha raggiunto il tempo massimo di veglia e ha lasciato andare il Mac in stop."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay достиг максимального времени без сна и разрешил Mac уснуть."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 达到最长唤醒时间，已让 Mac 进入睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay reached the longest stretch you allow it to hold, so it stopped.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Die maximale Wachzeit ist erreicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "The maximum awake time was reached."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Se alcanzó el tiempo máximo despierto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Le temps d'éveil maximal est atteint."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Raggiunto il tempo massimo di veglia."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Достигнут предел времени без сна."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已达到最长唤醒时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay reads only enough of your agent's session files to know whether it is running. Never your prompts, never your code, and nothing about you leaves this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay liest nur die Sitzungsdaten, die es braucht, um zu erkennen, ob ein Agent arbeitet. Deine Prompts und deinen Code liest es nie. Alles bleibt auf diesem Mac."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay reads only the session data it needs to tell whether an agent is working. It never reads your prompts or code. Everything stays on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay solo lee los datos de sesión que necesita para saber si un agente está trabajando. Nunca lee tus prompts ni tu código. Todo se queda en este Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay lit uniquement les données de session nécessaires pour savoir si un agent travaille. Il ne lit jamais vos prompts ni votre code. Tout reste sur ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay legge solo i dati di sessione necessari per capire se un agente sta lavorando. Non legge mai i tuoi prompt o il tuo codice. Tutto resta su questo Mac."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay читает только данные сессии, необходимые, чтобы понять, работает ли агент. Ваши промпты и код он не читает. Всё остаётся на этом Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 只读取判断智能体是否在工作所需的会话数据。它从不读取你的提示词或代码。一切都留在这台 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay reads only enough of your agent's session files to know whether it is running. Never your prompts, never your code, and nothing about you leaves this Mac. It uses the network twice: a daily check for a newer version, which you can switch off, and the download itself when you ask for one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay liest von den Sitzungsdateien deines Agenten nur so viel, wie nötig ist, um zu wissen, ob er arbeitet. Nie deine Prompts, nie deinen Code, und nichts über dich verlässt diesen Mac. Das Netzwerk nutzt Belay zweimal: für die tägliche Prüfung auf eine neue Version, die du abschalten kannst, und für den Download selbst, wenn du darum bittest."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay reads only enough of your agent's session files to know whether it is running. Never your prompts, never your code, and nothing about you leaves this Mac. It uses the network twice: a daily check for a newer version, which you can switch off, and the download itself when you ask for one."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay lee de los archivos de sesión de tu agente solo lo justo para saber si está trabajando. Nunca tus prompts, nunca tu código, y nada sobre ti sale de este Mac. Usa la red dos veces: la comprobación diaria de nuevas versiones, que puedes desactivar, y la descarga en sí cuando la pides."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ne lit des fichiers de session de votre agent que ce qu’il faut pour savoir s’il travaille. Jamais vos invites, jamais votre code, et rien vous concernant ne quitte ce Mac. Il utilise le réseau deux fois : la vérification quotidienne d’une nouvelle version, que vous pouvez désactiver, et le téléchargement lui-même quand vous le demandez."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay legge dei file di sessione del tuo agente solo quanto basta per sapere se sta lavorando. Mai i tuoi prompt, mai il tuo codice, e nulla che ti riguardi lascia questo Mac. Usa la rete due volte: il controllo giornaliero di una nuova versione, che puoi disattivare, e il download stesso quando lo chiedi."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay читает из файлов сессии вашего агента ровно столько, чтобы понять, работает ли он. Никогда ваши промпты, никогда ваш код, и ничего о вас не покидает этот Mac. Сеть используется дважды: ежедневная проверка новой версии, которую можно отключить, и сама загрузка, когда вы её запросите."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 只读取智能体会话文件中足以判断它是否在工作的部分。绝不读取你的提示词，绝不读取你的代码，关于你的任何信息都不会离开这台 Mac。它只在两种情况下使用网络：每天检查一次是否有新版本（可以关闭），以及在你请求时下载新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay refreshes the lid helper's registration at every launch, so keeping your Mac awake with the lid closed survives each update.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay erneuert die Registrierung des Deckel-Helfers bei jedem Start, damit das Wachhalten bei geschlossenem Deckel jedes Update übersteht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay refreshes the lid helper's registration at every launch, so keeping your Mac awake with the lid closed survives each update."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay renueva el registro del ayudante de la tapa en cada inicio, para que mantener el Mac despierto con la tapa cerrada sobreviva a cada actualización."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay renouvelle l'enregistrement de l'assistant du capot à chaque lancement, pour que garder le Mac éveillé capot fermé survive à chaque mise à jour."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay rinnova la registrazione dell'assistente del coperchio a ogni avvio, così tenere sveglio il Mac a coperchio chiuso sopravvive a ogni aggiornamento."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay обновляет регистрацию помощника при каждом запуске, поэтому удержание Mac с закрытой крышкой переживает каждое обновление."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 在每次启动时都会刷新合盖助手的注册，因此合盖保持唤醒在每次更新后仍然有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay saves crash, freeze, and error reports locally. Nothing is sent automatically. You decide what to share when reporting a problem.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sichert Absturz-, Hänger- und Fehlerberichte lokal. Nichts wird automatisch gesendet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saves crash, freeze, and error reports locally. Nothing is sent automatically."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guarda localmente los informes de fallos, bloqueos y errores. No se envía nada automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enregistre localement les rapports de plantage, blocage et erreur. Rien n'est envoyé automatiquement."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Salva localmente i rapporti di crash, blocchi ed errori. Nulla viene inviato automaticamente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Отчёты о сбоях, зависаниях и ошибках сохраняются локально. Данные не отправляются никуда, они служат инструментом для разработчиков и баг-репортеров."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在本地保存崩溃、卡死和错误报告。不会自动发送任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay still works in Always on and Off modes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Immer an“ und „Aus“ kannst du weiterhin verwenden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can still use Always On or Off."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puedes seguir usando «Siempre activo» o «Desactivado»."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pouvez toujours utiliser « Toujours actif » ou « Désactivé »."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puoi continuare a usare «Sempre attivo» o «Disattivato»."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Режимы «Всегда» и «Выключен» по-прежнему доступны."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你仍然可以使用“常开”或“关闭”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay stopped holding": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay hält nicht mehr"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay stopped holding"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay dejó de mantener"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay a cessé de maintenir"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha smesso di mantenere"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay перестал удерживать"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 已停止保持唤醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay stopped holding: battery is at %lld%%.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay hält deinen Mac bei %lld%% Akkustand nicht mehr wach."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay stopped keeping your Mac awake at %lld%% battery."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay dejó de mantener el Mac despierto al llegar al %lld%% de batería."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay a cessé de garder votre Mac éveillé à %lld%% de batterie."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha smesso di tenere sveglio il Mac al %lld%% di batteria."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "При заряде %lld%% Belay разрешил Mac уснуть."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电量降至 %lld%%，Belay 已停止保持唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay stopped holding: the maximum awake time was reached.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay hält deinen Mac nicht mehr wach: maximale Wachzeit erreicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay stopped keeping your Mac awake: maximum awake time reached."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay dejó de mantener el Mac despierto: se alcanzó el tiempo máximo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay a cessé de garder votre Mac éveillé : durée d'éveil maximale atteinte."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha smesso di tenere sveglio il Mac: raggiunto il tempo massimo di veglia."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay разрешил Mac уснуть: достигнуто максимальное время без сна."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已达到最长唤醒时间，Belay 已停止保持唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay stopped holding: the timer ran out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay hält deinen Mac nicht mehr wach: Der Timer ist abgelaufen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay stopped holding: the timer ran out."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay dejó de mantener el Mac despierto: el temporizador terminó."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay a cessé de garder votre Mac éveillé : le minuteur est terminé."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha smesso di tenere sveglio il Mac: il timer è scaduto."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay разрешил Mac уснуть: таймер истёк."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "计时器已结束，Belay 已停止保持唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay watches only enabled agents. Precise Detection gives Belay exact start, finish, and needs-you signals. Open an agent’s settings to manage detection or add folders to watch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay beobachtet nur aktivierte Agents. Die präzise Erkennung meldet Belay genau, wann Arbeit beginnt, endet oder deine Aufmerksamkeit nötig ist. In den Einstellungen eines Agents kannst du die Erkennung verwalten oder weitere Ordner überwachen lassen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay watches only enabled agents. Precise Detection gives Belay exact start, finish, and needs-you signals. Open an agent’s settings to manage detection or add folders to watch."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay solo supervisa los agentes activados. La detección precisa le indica exactamente cuándo empieza o termina el trabajo, o cuándo un agente te necesita. Abre los ajustes de un agente para gestionar la detección o añadir carpetas que quieras supervisar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ne surveille que les agents activés. La détection précise lui indique exactement quand le travail commence, se termine ou nécessite votre attention. Ouvrez les réglages d’un agent pour gérer la détection ou ajouter des dossiers à surveiller."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay monitora solo gli agenti attivati. Il rilevamento preciso indica a Belay esattamente quando il lavoro inizia, termina o richiede la tua attenzione. Apri le impostazioni di un agente per gestire il rilevamento o aggiungere cartelle da monitorare."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay следит только за включёнными агентами. Точное определение позволяет Belay понимать, когда работа начинается, заканчивается или требует вашего внимания. В настройках агента можно изменить режим определения или добавить другие папки для отслеживания."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 只会监控已启用的智能体。精确检测会让 Belay 准确知道工作何时开始、结束，以及何时需要你。打开智能体设置即可管理检测方式或添加要监控的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay will change %@ to:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ändert %@ in:"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay will update %@ to:"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay actualizará %@ a:"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay mettra %@ à jour ainsi :"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay aggiornerà %@ così:"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay изменит %@ на:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 会将 %@ 更新为："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay will keep holding no matter how low the battery gets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay hält deinen Mac auch bei niedrigem Akkustand wach."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay will keep your Mac awake even on low battery."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay mantendrá el Mac despierto incluso con poca batería."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay gardera votre Mac éveillé même si la batterie est faible."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay terrà sveglio il Mac anche con batteria scarica."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay не даст Mac уснуть даже при низком заряде."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使电量低，Belay 也会让 Mac 保持唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay will not change %@, because it is not in a format it can edit safely. Fix its format and open this again, and Belay will show you the exact change to review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ändert %@ nicht, weil das Format nicht sicher zurückgeschrieben werden kann. Bringe das Format in Ordnung und öffne dies erneut, dann zeigt Belay dir die genaue Änderung zur Prüfung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay will not change %@, because it is not in a format it can edit safely. Fix its format and open this again, and Belay will show you the exact change to review."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay no cambiará %@ porque no está en un formato que pueda editar con seguridad. Corrige su formato y vuelve a abrir esto, y Belay te mostrará el cambio exacto para revisar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ne modifiera pas %@, car son format ne peut pas être réécrit en toute sécurité. Corrigez son format et rouvrez ceci, et Belay vous montrera la modification exacte à vérifier."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay non modificherà %@ perché non è in un formato che può scrivere in sicurezza. Correggi il formato e riapri questa finestra, e Belay ti mostrerà la modifica esatta da controllare."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay не станет менять %@, потому что не может безопасно записать этот формат. Исправьте формат и откройте это снова, и Belay покажет точное изменение для проверки."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 不会更改 %@，因为它的格式无法安全写回。请修正其格式后再次打开，Belay 会向你展示要审阅的具体更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay will not edit this file, because it is not plain JSON. It may have comments or a format Belay cannot write back safely. Add this yourself instead:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay kann diese Datei nicht sicher bearbeiten, weil sie kein reines JSON ist. Füge dies stattdessen manuell hinzu:"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay can't safely edit this file because it isn't plain JSON. Add this manually instead:"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay no puede editar este archivo con seguridad porque no es JSON puro. Añádelo manualmente:"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ne peut pas modifier ce fichier en toute sécurité car il ne s'agit pas de JSON pur. Ajoutez ceci manuellement :"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay non può modificare questo file in sicurezza perché non è JSON puro. Aggiungilo manualmente:"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay не может безопасно изменить этот файл, потому что это не обычный JSON. Добавьте это вручную:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件不是纯 JSON，Belay 无法安全地修改它。请改为手动添加以下内容："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Belay will stop watching this folder for %@. Any Belay hooks inside it are removed as well. The folder itself is not touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay beobachtet diesen Ordner für %@ nicht mehr. Auch die Belay-Hooks darin werden entfernt. Der Ordner selbst bleibt unberührt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay will stop watching this folder for %@. Any Belay hooks inside it are removed as well. The folder itself is not touched."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay dejará de vigilar esta carpeta para %@. Los hooks de Belay en su interior también se eliminan. La carpeta en sí no se toca."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay cessera de surveiller ce dossier pour %@. Les hooks Belay qu'il contient sont également retirés. Le dossier lui-même n'est pas modifié."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay smetterà di osservare questa cartella per %@. Anche gli hook di Belay al suo interno vengono rimossi. La cartella in sé non viene toccata."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay перестанет следить за этой папкой для %@. Хуки Belay внутри неё тоже будут убраны. Сама папка не изменится."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 将停止为 %@ 监视此文件夹。其中的 Belay 钩子也会被移除。文件夹本身不会改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
