    "Every request in the Claude and Codex apps is approved without you seeing it, commands and file changes included. Switch this on only for work you would approve without reading.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Anfrage in den Apps Claude und Codex wird erlaubt, ohne dass du sie siehst, auch Befehle und Änderungen an Dateien. Schalte dies nur für Arbeit ein, die du ungelesen erlauben würdest."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every request in the Claude and Codex apps is approved without you seeing it, commands and file changes included. Switch this on only for work you would approve without reading."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todas las solicitudes de las apps de Claude y Codex se aprueban sin que las veas, incluidos los comandos y los cambios en archivos. Actívalo solo para trabajo que aprobarías sin leer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque demande dans les apps Claude et Codex est approuvée sans que vous la voyiez, commandes et modifications de fichiers comprises. N'activez ceci que pour un travail que vous approuveriez sans lire."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni richiesta nelle app Claude e Codex viene approvata senza che tu la veda, comandi e modifiche ai file compresi. Attivalo solo per un lavoro che approveresti senza leggere."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Каждый запрос в приложениях Claude и Codex подтверждается без вашего участия, включая команды и изменения файлов. Включайте только для работы, которую подтвердили бы не читая."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude 和 Codex App 中的每个请求都会在你看到之前被批准，包括命令和文件更改。仅在你愿意不看就批准的工作中开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
