    "The lid hold reached its time limit, so Belay let the Mac sleep.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Halten bei geschlossenem Deckel hat sein Zeitlimit erreicht, also hat Belay den Mac schlafen lassen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The lid hold reached its time limit, so Belay let the Mac sleep."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La retención con la tapa cerrada alcanzó su límite de tiempo, así que Belay dejó dormir el Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le maintien capot fermé a atteint sa limite de temps, alors Belay a laissé le Mac dormir."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il mantenimento a coperchio chiuso ha raggiunto il limite di tempo, così Belay ha lasciato dormire il Mac."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Удержание с закрытой крышкой достигло лимита времени, и Belay дал Mac уснуть."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合盖保持唤醒已到达时间上限，Belay 已让 Mac 进入睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The longest Belay will keep your Mac awake before letting go. You'll be notified when the limit is reached.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die längste Zeit, die Belay den Mac wach hält, bevor er loslässt. Bei Erreichen des Limits wirst du benachrichtigt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The longest Belay will keep your Mac awake before letting go. You'll be notified when the limit is reached."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El tiempo máximo que Belay mantendrá el Mac despierto antes de soltarlo. Se te notificará al alcanzar el límite."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La durée maximale pendant laquelle Belay garde le Mac éveillé avant de lâcher prise. Vous serez averti quand la limite est atteinte."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tempo massimo per cui Belay terrà sveglio il Mac prima di lasciare andare. Riceverai una notifica al raggiungimento del limite."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Максимальное время удержания Mac бодрым. При достижении лимита Belay отправит вам уведомление."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 保持 Mac 唤醒的最长时间，超过后就会放手。达到上限时会通知你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone is let go while the Mac runs on its battery and picked up again on power.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Mikrofon wird freigegeben, solange der Mac im Batteriebetrieb läuft, und am Netzteil wieder geöffnet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone is let go while the Mac runs on its battery and picked up again on power."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El micrófono se suelta mientras el Mac funciona con batería y se vuelve a abrir al conectarlo a la corriente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le micro est relâché tant que le Mac fonctionne sur batterie et rouvert une fois sur secteur."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il microfono viene rilasciato mentre il Mac funziona a batteria e riaperto quando torna all'alimentazione."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Микрофон отпускается, пока Mac работает от аккумулятора, и снова открывается при питании от сети."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 使用电池时放开麦克风，接通电源后重新开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
