    "When the work stops, your Mac sleeps as it always did. Your sleep settings are never changed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn die Arbeit endet, schläft dein Mac wie immer. Deine Energieeinstellungen bleiben unangetastet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the work stops, your Mac sleeps as it always did. Your sleep settings are never changed."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando el trabajo termina, tu Mac duerme como siempre. Tus ajustes de suspensión no se tocan."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand le travail s'arrête, votre Mac se met en veille comme d'habitude. Vos réglages de veille ne sont jamais modifiés."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando il lavoro finisce, il Mac va in stop come sempre. Le tue impostazioni di stop non vengono toccate."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Когда работа заканчивается, Mac засыпает как обычно. Ваши настройки сна не меняются."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作停止后，Mac 会像以往一样进入睡眠。睡眠设置不会有任何更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While an Always on timer runs, the remaining time glows quietly on the dark display, the way a bedside clock would.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeigt die verbleibende Zeit, während ein „Immer an“-Timer läuft."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows the time left while an Always On timer is running."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muestra el tiempo restante mientras corre un temporizador de Siempre."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affiche le temps restant pendant qu'un minuteur Toujours est en cours."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mostra il tempo rimanente mentre è attivo un timer di Sempre."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Показывает оставшееся время, когда включён таймер в режиме Always On (Всегда)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "常开计时器运行时显示剩余时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While holding": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Während des Haltens"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While holding"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mientras mantiene"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant le maintien"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mentre mantiene"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Пока удерживает"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持唤醒期间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the microphone is held, macOS shows the orange microphone dot. Belay listens to nothing: the sound is thrown away as it arrives, never recorded, stored or sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solange das Mikrofon offen gehalten wird, zeigt macOS den orangefarbenen Mikrofonpunkt. Belay hört nichts ab: Der Ton wird sofort verworfen, nie aufgenommen, gespeichert oder gesendet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While the microphone is held, macOS shows the orange microphone dot. Belay listens to nothing: the sound is thrown away as it arrives, never recorded, stored or sent."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mientras el micrófono se mantiene abierto, macOS muestra el punto naranja del micrófono. Belay no escucha nada: el sonido se descarta en cuanto llega y nunca se graba, se guarda ni se envía."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tant que le micro est maintenu ouvert, macOS affiche le point orange du micro. Belay n'écoute rien : le son est jeté dès qu'il arrive, jamais enregistré, conservé ni envoyé."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finché il microfono è tenuto aperto, macOS mostra il punto arancione del microfono. Belay non ascolta nulla: l'audio viene scartato appena arriva, mai registrato, salvato o inviato."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Пока микрофон удерживается, macOS показывает оранжевую точку микрофона. Belay ничего не слушает: звук отбрасывается сразу, не записывается, не сохраняется и не отправляется."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持麦克风开启期间，macOS 会显示橙色麦克风指示点。Belay 什么都不听：声音一到即被丢弃，从不录制、存储或发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you were away": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Während Sie weg waren"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While you were away"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mientras no estabas"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant votre absence"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mentre eri via"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Пока вас не было"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在您离开期间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With precise detection, %@ tells Belay the exact moment work starts, stops, or waits for you. Detection becomes instant and reliable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit präziser Erkennung meldet %@ Belay den genauen Moment, in dem Arbeit beginnt, endet oder auf dich wartet. Die Erkennung wird sofort und zuverlässig."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With precise detection, %@ tells Belay the exact moment work starts, stops, or waits for you. Detection becomes instant and reliable."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con la detección precisa, %@ le dice a Belay el momento exacto en que el trabajo empieza, termina o te espera. La detección se vuelve instantánea y fiable."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec la détection précise, %@ indique à Belay le moment exact où le travail commence, s'arrête ou vous attend. La détection devient instantanée et fiable."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con il rilevamento preciso, %@ dice a Belay il momento esatto in cui il lavoro inizia, finisce o ti aspetta. Il rilevamento diventa istantaneo e affidabile."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "С точным определением %@ сам сообщает Belay, когда работа началась, закончилась или ждёт вас. Определение становится мгновенным и надёжным."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用精确检测后，%@ 会在工作开始、结束或等待你的那一刻直接告诉 Belay。检测变得即时而可靠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arbeitet"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Working"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trabajando"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En cours"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Al lavoro"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Работает"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works in the Claude and Codex desktop apps. Local sites are localhost, names ending in .local or .test, and addresses on your own network. Everything else waits for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funktioniert in den Desktop-Apps von Claude und Codex. Lokale Websites sind localhost, Namen, die auf .local oder .test enden, und Adressen in deinem eigenen Netzwerk. Alles andere wartet auf dich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works in the Claude and Codex desktop apps. Local sites are localhost, names ending in .local or .test, and addresses on your own network. Everything else waits for you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funciona en las apps de escritorio de Claude y Codex. Los sitios locales son localhost, los nombres que terminan en .local o .test y las direcciones de tu propia red. Todo lo demás te espera."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fonctionne dans les apps de bureau Claude et Codex. Les sites locaux sont localhost, les noms se terminant par .local ou .test et les adresses de votre propre réseau. Tout le reste vous attend."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funziona nelle app desktop di Claude e Codex. I siti locali sono localhost, i nomi che finiscono in .local o .test e gli indirizzi della tua rete. Tutto il resto aspetta te."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Работает в настольных приложениях Claude и Codex. Локальные сайты: localhost, имена с окончанием .local или .test и адреса в вашей собственной сети. Всё остальное ждёт вас."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于 Claude 和 Codex 桌面 App。本地网站指 localhost、以 .local 或 .test 结尾的名称，以及你自己网络中的地址。其余请求都会等你处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You asked Belay to stay on until you switch it off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ihr Mac bleibt wach, bis Sie es ausschalten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Your Mac stays awake until you turn it off."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Tu Mac sigue despierto hasta que lo desactives."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Votre Mac reste éveillé tant que c'est activé."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Il Mac resta sveglio finché non lo disattivi."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Mac не уснёт, пока вы не выключите режим."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 将保持唤醒，直到你关闭为止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Claude Code settings file has a hooks entry Belay does not recognise, so it made no changes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay hat in deinen Claude-Code-Einstellungen einen hooks-Eintrag gefunden, den es nicht erkennt. Deshalb wurde nichts geändert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay found a hooks entry in your Claude Code settings that it doesn't recognize, so nothing was changed."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay encontró una entrada hooks en tus ajustes de Claude Code que no reconoce, así que no cambió nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay a trouvé dans vos réglages Claude Code une entrée hooks qu'il ne reconnaît pas. Rien n'a donc été modifié."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay ha trovato nelle impostazioni di Claude Code una voce hooks che non riconosce, quindi non ha modificato nulla."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay нашёл в настройках Claude Code раздел hooks, который не распознал, поэтому ничего не изменил."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
